{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_130_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_130","textTraditional":"一、十有六年，春，王正月，晉人滅赤狄甲氏及留吁。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_130_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_130","textTraditional":"二、夏，成周宣榭災。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_130_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_130","textTraditional":"周災，不志也，其曰宣榭何也？以樂器之所藏，目之也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_130_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_130","textTraditional":"三、秋，郯伯姬來歸。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_130_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_130","textTraditional":"四、冬，大有年。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_130_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_130","textTraditional":"五穀大熟為大有年。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}